{"title": "Spell Slot Restoration Level 5", "pageid": 23920, "url": "https://bg3.wiki/wiki/Spell_Slot_Restoration_Level_5", "categories": ["Class actions", "Actions", "Resource replenishing actions"], "html": "<div class=\"mw-content-ltr mw-parser-output\" lang=\"en\" dir=\"ltr\">\n<div class=\"bg3wiki-tooltip-box bg3wiki-tooltip-gradient-common\">\n<figure class=\"mw-default-size mw-halign-right\" typeof=\"mw:File/Frameless\"><a href=\"/wiki/File:Spell_Slot_Restoration_Level_5.webp\" class=\"mw-file-description\"><picture><source srcset=\"/w/images/thumb/5/5f/Spell_Slot_Restoration_Level_5.webp/300px-Spell_Slot_Restoration_Level_5.webp, /w/images/5/5f/Spell_Slot_Restoration_Level_5.webp 1.5x\"><img src=\"/w/images/thumb/5/5f/Spell_Slot_Restoration_Level_5.webp/300px-Spell_Slot_Restoration_Level_5.webp\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"300\" height=\"300\" class=\"mw-file-element\"></picture></a><a href=\"/w/images/5/5f/Spell_Slot_Restoration_Level_5.webp\" class=\"mw-file-source\" title=\"View source image\"><!-- Image link for Crawlers --></a><figcaption></figcaption></figure><b>Spell Slot Restoration Level 5</b> is a class action granted by the <span class=\"nowrap bg3wiki-icontext-icon\"><span class=\"bg3wiki-itemicon bg3wiki-itemicon-very-rare\"><span class=\"bg3wiki-icon\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"/wiki/Spellcrux_Amulet\" title=\"Spellcrux Amulet\"><picture><source srcset=\"/w/images/thumb/1/13/Amulet_Necklace_D_Gold_A_1_Unfaded_Icon.png/20px-Amulet_Necklace_D_Gold_A_1_Unfaded_Icon.png.webp, /w/images/thumb/1/13/Amulet_Necklace_D_Gold_A_1_Unfaded_Icon.png/30px-Amulet_Necklace_D_Gold_A_1_Unfaded_Icon.png.webp 1.5x, /w/images/thumb/1/13/Amulet_Necklace_D_Gold_A_1_Unfaded_Icon.png/40px-Amulet_Necklace_D_Gold_A_1_Unfaded_Icon.png.webp 2x\"><img alt=\"\" src=\"/w/images/thumb/1/13/Amulet_Necklace_D_Gold_A_1_Unfaded_Icon.png/20px-Amulet_Necklace_D_Gold_A_1_Unfaded_Icon.png.webp\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"20\" height=\"20\" class=\"mw-file-element\"></picture></a><a href=\"/w/images/1/13/Amulet_Necklace_D_Gold_A_1_Unfaded_Icon.png\" class=\"mw-file-source\" title=\"View source image\"><!-- Image link for Crawlers --></a></span></span></span> <a href=\"/wiki/Spellcrux_Amulet\" title=\"Spellcrux Amulet\">Spellcrux Amulet</a>. It is one of the choices for <span class=\"bg3wiki-icontext-icon nowrap\"><span class=\"bg3wiki-icon\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"/wiki/Spell_Slot_Restoration\" title=\"Spell Slot Restoration\"><picture><source srcset=\"/w/images/thumb/b/b6/Spell_Slot_Restoration_Icon.webp/20px-Spell_Slot_Restoration_Icon.webp, /w/images/thumb/b/b6/Spell_Slot_Restoration_Icon.webp/30px-Spell_Slot_Restoration_Icon.webp 1.5x, /w/images/thumb/b/b6/Spell_Slot_Restoration_Icon.webp/40px-Spell_Slot_Restoration_Icon.webp 2x\"><img alt=\"Spell Slot Restoration\" src=\"/w/images/thumb/b/b6/Spell_Slot_Restoration_Icon.webp/20px-Spell_Slot_Restoration_Icon.webp\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"20\" height=\"20\" class=\"mw-file-element\"></picture></a><a href=\"/w/images/b/b6/Spell_Slot_Restoration_Icon.webp\" class=\"mw-file-source\" title=\"View source image\"><!-- Image link for Crawlers --></a></span></span> <a href=\"/wiki/Spell_Slot_Restoration\" title=\"Spell Slot Restoration\">Spell Slot Restoration</a> which restores a single level 5 spell slot once per <a href=\"/wiki/Long_Rest\" class=\"mw-redirect\" title=\"Long Rest\">Long Rest</a>.\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Description\"> Description </span></h2>\nRecover a Level 5 <a href=\"/wiki/Spell_Slot\" class=\"mw-redirect\" title=\"Spell Slot\">spell slot</a>.<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Properties\"> Properties </span></h2>\n<div class=\"bg3wiki-property-list\">\n<dl><dt>Cost</dt>\n<dd><span style=\"margin: -3px\"><span class=\"mw-default-size bg3wiki-icon nowrap\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><span><picture><source srcset=\"/w/images/thumb/f/f2/Action_Icon.png/28px-Action_Icon.png.webp, /w/images/thumb/f/f2/Action_Icon.png/42px-Action_Icon.png.webp 1.5x, /w/images/f/f2/Action_Icon.png 2x\"><img alt=\"\" src=\"/w/images/thumb/f/f2/Action_Icon.png/28px-Action_Icon.png.webp\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"28\" height=\"28\" class=\"mw-file-element\"></picture></span><a href=\"/w/images/f/f2/Action_Icon.png\" class=\"mw-file-source\" title=\"View source image\"><!-- Image link for Crawlers --></a></span></span> <a href=\"/wiki/Actions#Resources\" title=\"Actions\">Action</a></dd>\n<dt>Details</dt>\n<dd><span class=\"bg3wiki-icontext-icon nowrap\"><span class=\"mw-default-size bg3wiki-icon\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><span><picture><source srcset=\"/w/images/thumb/0/08/Range_Icon.png/25px-Range_Icon.png.webp, /w/images/thumb/0/08/Range_Icon.png/38px-Range_Icon.png.webp 1.5x, /w/images/0/08/Range_Icon.png 2x\"><img alt=\"Range: Self\" src=\"/w/images/thumb/0/08/Range_Icon.png/25px-Range_Icon.png.webp\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"25\" height=\"25\" class=\"mw-file-element\"></picture></span><a href=\"/w/images/0/08/Range_Icon.png\" class=\"mw-file-source\" title=\"View source image\"><!-- Image link for Crawlers --></a></span></span> Range: Self</dd>\n<dd><span class=\"bg3wiki-icontext-icon nowrap\"><span class=\"mw-default-size bg3wiki-icon\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><span><picture><source srcset=\"/w/images/thumb/f/fd/Recharge_Icons.png/25px-Recharge_Icons.png.webp, /w/images/thumb/f/fd/Recharge_Icons.png/38px-Recharge_Icons.png.webp 1.5x, /w/images/f/fd/Recharge_Icons.png 2x\"><img alt=\"Recharge: Long rest\" src=\"/w/images/thumb/f/fd/Recharge_Icons.png/25px-Recharge_Icons.png.webp\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"25\" height=\"25\" class=\"mw-file-element\"></picture></span><a href=\"/w/images/f/fd/Recharge_Icons.png\" class=\"mw-file-source\" title=\"View source image\"><!-- Image link for Crawlers --></a></span></span> Recharge: <a href=\"/wiki/Long_rest\" class=\"mw-redirect\" title=\"Long rest\">Long rest</a></dd></dl>\n</div>\n<div style=\"clear: both;\"></div></div><h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"How_to_learn\"> How to learn </span></h2>\n<div class=\"bg3wiki-tooltip-box\">\n<p>Granted by items:\n</p>\n<ul>\n<li><span class=\"bg3wiki-icontext-block\" style=\"gap: 6px\"><span class=\"nowrap bg3wiki-icontext-icon\"><span class=\"bg3wiki-itemicon bg3wiki-itemicon-very-rare\"><span class=\"bg3wiki-icon\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"/wiki/Spellcrux_Amulet\" title=\"Spellcrux Amulet\"><picture><source srcset=\"/w/images/thumb/1/13/Amulet_Necklace_D_Gold_A_1_Unfaded_Icon.png/30px-Amulet_Necklace_D_Gold_A_1_Unfaded_Icon.png.webp, /w/images/thumb/1/13/Amulet_Necklace_D_Gold_A_1_Unfaded_Icon.png/45px-Amulet_Necklace_D_Gold_A_1_Unfaded_Icon.png.webp 1.5x, /w/images/thumb/1/13/Amulet_Necklace_D_Gold_A_1_Unfaded_Icon.png/60px-Amulet_Necklace_D_Gold_A_1_Unfaded_Icon.png.webp 2x\"><img alt=\"\" src=\"/w/images/thumb/1/13/Amulet_Necklace_D_Gold_A_1_Unfaded_Icon.png/30px-Amulet_Necklace_D_Gold_A_1_Unfaded_Icon.png.webp\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"30\" height=\"30\" class=\"mw-file-element\"></picture></a><a href=\"/w/images/1/13/Amulet_Necklace_D_Gold_A_1_Unfaded_Icon.png\" class=\"mw-file-source\" title=\"View source image\"><!-- Image link for Crawlers --></a></span></span></span><a href=\"/wiki/Spellcrux_Amulet\" title=\"Spellcrux Amulet\">Spellcrux Amulet</a></span> </li>\n</ul>\n<p>This spell is a variation of:<br>\n<span class=\"bg3wiki-icontext-block\" style=\"gap: 6px\"><span class=\"bg3wiki-icontext-icon nowrap\" style=\"\"><span class=\"bg3wiki-icon\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"/wiki/Spell_Slot_Restoration\" title=\"Spell Slot Restoration\"><picture><source srcset=\"/w/images/thumb/b/b6/Spell_Slot_Restoration_Icon.webp/40px-Spell_Slot_Restoration_Icon.webp, /w/images/thumb/b/b6/Spell_Slot_Restoration_Icon.webp/60px-Spell_Slot_Restoration_Icon.webp 1.5x, /w/images/thumb/b/b6/Spell_Slot_Restoration_Icon.webp/80px-Spell_Slot_Restoration_Icon.webp 2x\"><img alt=\"Spell Slot Restoration\" src=\"/w/images/thumb/b/b6/Spell_Slot_Restoration_Icon.webp/40px-Spell_Slot_Restoration_Icon.webp\" decoding=\"async\" widt